# Never upload local env files. `vercel deploy` from a developer machine would
# otherwise ship frontend/.env.local — which points NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL at
# http://localhost:8000/api — into the production build, so the deployed site
# calls the developer's own machine and loads no data for real visitors.
# Production values must come from the Vercel project's environment variables.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
